record.content:
Bosons are particles with integer spin. They are described by Bose-Einstein statistics, meaning that two bosons can occupy the same quantum state.
\subsection{List of bosons}
\begin{itemize}
\item Proton
\item Neutron
\item W boson
\item Z boson
\item Higgs boson
\item Graviton
\end{itemize}
